:Namespace GameState
    ⍝ Representation of the game state as a compact numeric vector.
    
    ⎕IO ⎕ML←1
    
    ⍝ Indices into the game state vector. A flat vector keeps each
    ⍝ position small.
    side←1
    castling_rights←1+⍳4
    en_passant_square←6
    halfmove←7
    fullmove←8

    init←{
        ⍝ Game state vector from named fields.
        ⍝ ⍵ ←→ namespace with side, castling_rights, en_passant_square,
        ⍝      halfmove and fullmove
        ⍝ ← ←→ game state vector

        max_index←⌈/∊side castling_rights en_passant_square halfmove fullmove
        game_state←max_index⍴0
        names←'side' 'castling_rights'  'en_passant_square' 'halfmove' 'fullmove'
        game_state[∊side castling_rights en_passant_square halfmove fullmove]←∊⍵ ⎕VGET names
        game_state
    }

:EndNamespace
